<title>FRANCE: Bic 1996 sales rise.</title>
<headline>Bic 1996 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 6,426    vs    5,993</p>
<p>NOTE - BIC said in a statement that on a like-for-like basis and at constant currency rates, 1996 sales rose seven percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
